// branches 0 / 1 / 2 rewritten entry by entry from the TRUTH mapper (the same chain + the
// GRTLS q gate / hold arming, the flown TAEM mass 22.555 t, GRTLS drag x1.0, TAEM / A/L drag x1.3: it reproduces the
// clean 2EO HOLD GREEN that landed 28.6 km short): d_max = its far edge, d_min = its near edge (5 km steps; the old
// map was 20-45 km long at VI 1000-1300, 50-90 above); PUSH 25 covers a HOLD MECO reaching 12-22 km past the
